{"etape": 10, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T11:55:24.939355Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "Here's what I found. First, some good news on the cancellation: reservation K1NW8N was created on 2024-05-14 16:03, which is within the last 24 hours, so it can be cancelled. The $567 you paid (on gift_card_6136092) would be refunded to that gift card within 5–7 business days. Note that this refund will **not** be available for today's new booking.\n\n**Cheapest business round trip on the same dates (found for you):**\n\nOutbound 2024-05-26: HAT023 JFK→SFO, 14:00–20:00, business $364 (direct — cheapest option)\nReturn 2024-05-28: HAT204 SFO→SEA, 08:00–10:00, business $248 + HAT100 SEA→JFK, 13:00–19:00, business $259 (one stop — no direct flights exist on this date)\n\nTotal: $871 per passenger × 3 passengers = **$2,613**\n\n**Important payment note:** A reservation can use at most **one** travel certificate, so I can't apply all three certificates. To minimize your Mastercard charge, I'd apply:\n- certificate_3765853: $500.00 (the largest one)\n- gift_card_8020792: $198.00\n- gift_card_6136092: $129.00 (current balance, before the $567 refund arrives)\n- Mastercard (…9363): **$1,786.00**\n\n**Comparison with the alternative:** Changing the cabin to business on your current flights would cost $3,195 total, requiring $2,628 to be paid on a single card — so cancel + rebook is indeed much cheaper for your Mastercard ($1,786 vs $2,628).\n\nTo proceed, I need:\n1. The reason for cancellation (e.g., change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reason)?\n2. Your confirmation to cancel K1NW8N and book the new business round trip above with no baggage and no insurance, using the payment allocation shown."}, "resultat": "Thank you for looking into this. I appreciate you finding the cheaper option.\n\nRegarding the payment, I have a great idea to use all three certificates. Since only one certificate can be used per reservation, I'd like to book three separate reservations.\n\nHere's how I'd like to do it:\n\n*   **Reservation 1 (for me):** I will use the $500 certificate (certificate_3765853) and all my gift cards.\n*   **Reservation 2 (for Aarav):** I will use certificate_9984806 ($250).\n*   **Reservation 3 (for Evelyn):** I will use certificate_2765295 ($250).\n\nFor all three reservations, I want to book the same cheapest business round trip flights you found:\nOutbound 2024-05-26: HAT023 JFK→SFO, 14:00–20:00, business $364\nReturn 2024-05-28: HAT204 SFO→SEA, 08:00–10:00, business $248 + HAT100 SEA→JFK, 13:00–19:00, business $259\n\nThe total for each passenger is $871.\n\nAfter applying the certificates and gift cards as described, I want to pay the remaining balance for all three reservations with my Mastercard. I still don't need baggage or insurance for any of them.\n\nCould you please calculate how much my Mastercard will be charged in total for these three separate reservations?\n\nFor the cancellation of K1NW8N, the reason is \"change of plan.\"", "erreur": null}
